regression techniques which can not model growth curves (such as R
already has) are more statistically sound that stepwise regression
techniques which can model growth curves?  I have several authorities
to the contrary and would like to share them with you and the group.

Please send me a copy of the paper you submitted so I know what I am
responding to.

Sincerely,
James Salsman

